  "title": "Coconut Gumdrop Cookies",
  "description": "This gumdrop cookie recipe is chewy and sweet. The flavors of oatmeal, coconut, gumdrops, and pecans are blended to perfection.",
  "authors": [
    "Sallie"
  ],
